  "description": "Tired of squinting at strings for Cyrillic homoglyphs? Squint does it for you. UTS #39 Unicode Security Mechanisms from the Unicode 17.0 data: confusable skeletons, single/mixed/whole-script confusable classification, Script_Extensions and resolved script sets, restriction levels, Identifier_Status and Identifier_Type, mixed-number detection, and the four normalization forms. Pure managed code with its own normaliser, so it needs no ICU and gives the same answer on every platform.",
